    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0,
      "members": [],
      "original": "지나왔던 모든 자리, 바라보며 Scream and shout it",
      "romanization": "jinawatteon modeun jari, barabomyeo scream and shout it",
      "english": "Looking back on all the places we've been, Looking on and scream and shout it",
      "adlib": false
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0,
      "members": [],
      "original": "너와 함께, I’m a different person today",
      "romanization": "neowa hamkke, i’m a different person today",
      "english": "Together with you, I’m a different person today",
      "adlib": false
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0,
      "members": [],
      "original": "펼쳐지는 New phase, 한 발 내딛기 전에 Wait ay",
      "romanization": "pyeolchyeojineun new phase, han bal naeditgi jeone wait ay",
      "english": "A new phase unfolds, Before taking a step forward Wait ay",
      "adlib": false
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0,
      "members": [],
      "original": "어제의 상상 속, 그릴 수 없던 모습도",
